Reused excerpts and changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b) change notes):
1. Schema and entity definitions (node labels, relationship types, property
   names and key properties for Vulnerability, Exploit, Author, Weakness,
   Product, Vendor, Domain; constraint and index names such as UniqueCveID).
   Changes: CVSS score properties are stored as decimals (VulKG casts several
   to integers); no range index on Vulnerability.description (a full-text
   index is used instead).

No VulKG data, load scripts, or expected counts are included. BSKG fills the
graph only from live sources.
